DINT_S="[Vox Day Interview on Evolutionary Theory](https://billdembski.substack.com/p/vox-day-interview-on-evolutionary) (Dembski Substack), 2026-09-28, appended chapter 'From Probability Zero (2nd ed.) on 1966 Wistar Symposium, Chapter 6: The 1966 Meeting of the Minds' (primary Day text, posted with Day's permission)"
