 q(E4)+f"\n\nSource: {WS}, p.7.\n\n"+q(E5)+"\n\nSource: same, p.7 (the sentence that licenses reading the 10^52 as covering 'all the useful proteins which have existed').\n\n"+q(d3a_day)+f"\n\nSource: {DINT_S}. Day's Best They've Got I (2026-10-05) says: 'the number of functional proteins that have ever existed is ~10^52' (see D).",
